  "body": "Found while fixing #1537.\n\n`depth_law_of` (`crates/app/src/operation/generate.rs`) gives a Circular op `DepthLaw::None` for every source, so a Circular whose source is the whole finished part (`SrcRef::Entity`, `part_solid` true) is never judged against the part: a circle typed through a wall would post with no gouge warning. #1537 settled this for Slot only (every part-solid Slot now takes `DepthLaw::Section`); Circular was left out because its existing uses (bosses, circular pockets on a whole model) need their own read before the law changes.\n\nDone means: decide Circular's law on a finished-part source; if it is `Section`, a test with an Entity(\"part\") Circular cut through a wall gets a blocking `Warning::Gouge`, a Stock source still cuts unjudged, and existing Circular tests are read for whether they pinned the unsafe case.\n\nRefs #1537\n",
